# Translation card. Needs network and translate-shell for the result: not testable here, but the card and the error show. Check in each look.
setup foot & 
wait 2
ipc screen region translate
wait 1
ptr move 100 200 sleep 100 down glide 500 260 300 up
wait 2
shot tr-card
note Card at x 100, y 268, 400 wide: "Translating..." then the result or "Couldn't translate..." in red (no network: the error is expected in both shells).
key -k Escape
wait 1
ipc screen region translate
wait 1
ptr move 4 200 sleep 100 down glide 500 260 300 up
wait 2
shot tr-left-edge
note Drag started at (4,200): the card's left edge is at x 24 in both shells (Rust was at 4 before the fix).
ptr move 1020 255 sleep 300 glide 1020 255 50
wait 1
shot tr-hover
note Hover on the Copy / Close buttons at the heading's right end: Glass fillHover, Material state layer (compare with QML).
ptr move 1020 255 sleep 200 down
shot tr-press
note Material: pressed Close is swelled (about 34 px) with r 8 (position approximate: use the button at the heading's right end); Glass: 97 %. NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness.
ptr move 1020 255 up
wait 1
ptr move 600 300 click
key -k Escape
wait 1
shot tr-closed
note Clicking into the card then Escape closes the card; no card remains.
